{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"00b319d7ae838cc3d3bba24368ea64c217cac19ea4aca8fe59d45eca2dc63c2f","digest":{"component_or_area":"ticket close gate","key_entities":["src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py","src/rebar/_commands/compact_txn.py","_compact_on_close","compact_txn._compact_locked",".ticket-write.lock","src/rebar/_store/gitutil.py","tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py","docs/concurrency.md","rebar compact"],"problem_keywords":["lock contention","compaction","ticket close","store write lock","unbounded hold time"],"propositions":["Closing a ticket triggers _compact_on_close which holds the store write lock for minutes (measured 13m53s), freezing all other agent writes.","The compaction fold inside _compact_locked takes a single store write lock and holds it through the entire fold (read, reduce, ledger, snapshot, retire, git add/commit) with no bounded timeout.","Compaction is optional housekeeping, not a correctness requirement — unfolded event logs are valid and the reducer replays them correctly.","Removing _compact_on_close from the close path restores lock-hold time to seconds, unblocking stalled agents while compaction remains available via rebar compact CLI and planned out-of-band triggers."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787700238859994001,"uuid":"2ffd6be3-8a9f-4b04-a64b-c206b1a727bc"}